# Cycle through things offers what the hand reaches on a table (the tavern on map 39), as far as the mouse may pick things up: bottles, tankards, tubers, not only what "use" reaches
args: --map 39 --pos 15567,12286,48
do: t5;pickthing:1;pickthing:1;pickthing:1;pickthing:1;pickthing:1;pickthing:1;pickthing:1
expect: pickthing name: Some("Cloven Hoof")
expect: pickthing name: Some("tankard")
expect: pickthing name: Some("tuber")
expect: pickthing name: Some("Breath o' Spirit")
